# Rever ImGui – Run After Changes

When you edit files under `rever_imgui/`, **always run the app after making changes** so the user can verify behavior.

**How to run:**
```bash
cd rever_imgui && .venv/bin/python main.py
```
Run in the background (e.g. `is_background: true`) so the window stays open.

If the venv is missing or deps are not installed:
```bash
cd rever_imgui && python3 -m venv .venv && .venv/bin/pip install -r requirements.txt -q && .venv/bin/python main.py
```
